x-kernel Chromium Runtime
Copyright 2026 the x-kernel Chromium Runtime contributors

This repository contains patches, tooling and documentation for running
Chromium on x-kernel.  The kernel itself is derived from:

    x-kernel
    https://gitee.com/openkylin/x-kernel
    Copyright openKylin and the x-kernel contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The files under kernel-changes/ are modified versions of upstream files and
retain their original SPDX headers.  The patches under patches/ are provided
under the same license.

The three HTML pages under pages/ were supplied by the competition organisers
for acceptance testing; they are included here unchanged for reproducibility.

QEMU is used as an external tool and is not distributed in this repository.
Chromium, Xorg, JWM and the guest user space are part of the separately
supplied guest image and are not distributed here.
